==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|grc|ἄγρωστις|t=grass}}, from {{m|grc|ἄγρωστης|t=farmer}}, from {{m|grc|ἀγρός|t=field}} + {{m|grc|λόγος|t=study, speech, reason}}.

